      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / ORIGINALS 002\nMORPHING STATE PAD\n\nHOST MIDI: pitch and gate -> Morph VCO\nMORPH VCO -> State Filter LP -> VCA\nADSR opens VCA; stereo host output.\n\nMACRO8: Shape, Resonance, Drive\nMACRO8 knobs control 0-10V CV outputs.\nPress snapshot A/B to morph pad timbre;\nLIVE returns control to the knobs.\nUse the STORE toggle to overwrite a slot.\n\nVCA and host output gains are reduced.\nExternal samples/plugins are not needed.\nFundamental ADSR/VCA are bundled in Cardinal.\n",
        "width": 29
      },
